{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1da591ceaf6050eca291fc2a6266363658c4023fae206a90ca641c31e060a21a", "ja": "今日の仕事は、悪名高いバラエティ番組、\n『アイドル・バトルロワイヤル』だ。", "zh": "今天的工作是恶名昭彰的综艺节目──\n《偶像大乱斗》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f76f9c6dc050d520f96acb02c2f1b13defaabf90d3c633e9f922b3001d862c6b", "ja": "茜、わかっているとは思うが……。", "zh": "茜，我想你应该很清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "f0b1b8863c4ec78fea7f8e4a1e0feee222e6690d30973fdaa8d4f2b8d118f6f7", "ja": "うん、茜ちゃん知ってるよ！　この番組で\nゲームに負けると、画面にすら映らないってコト……！", "zh": "嗯，小茜知道喔！\n这个节目只要玩游戏输了，就会连一个镜头都没有……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "a24d7868f5645c53fad1ba472fbc67a6596d5817d1979f47a62a90c8194bb5b9", "ja": "まっ、万能天才美少女の\n茜ちゃんなら、ラクショーだけど！", "zh": "不过嘛，这对万能天才美少女小茜来说，\n根本只是小事一桩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "07a3f2682beb634964443fe836bec1167347608eae4656eac637cfaf2e0510a7", "ja": "見ててよ、{$P$}ちゃん。\n茜ちゃんがテレビ画面をひとりじめにしてくるからさ！", "zh": "你看着吧，小{$P$}，\n小茜会一个人独占电视镜头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1005_p", "source_sha256": "69bcb1415aea2243d5815a1a80d885c93c90a659f1605c79f51420533f7883a8", "ja": "（……そんな甘ったれた考えも今日までだぞ、茜。\nこの番組は、本当に情け容赦がないからな！）", "zh": "（……那种天真的想法就到今天为止了，茜。\n这个节目是真的不讲情面喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1006_null", "source_sha256": "6b6a5df7c4dc8ca0d959f60d9de9cd5a09dfb7c543ef530f8741e33bc15181c9", "ja": "そして、番組の収録が始まった……", "zh": "接着，节目开始录影了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "3d25356be0859b17c2e9eba6e4c64859e9729299b3e84c9e84ccc38d5a695e4e", "ja": "はいはーい！　茜ちゃん、答えわかるよ！\n答えは……シュバルツシルト半径！", "zh": "有有有──！小茜知道答案！\n答案是……史瓦西半径！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1008_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "5a83034fee0e6a0bf63c54b65b37bf77a0cedba48e5b31658e4b7cec3e391405", "ja": "野々原茜選手、正解です！\nなんと、これでさらに10点リード！", "zh": "野野原茜选手答对了！\n这样一来又多领先10分了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1009_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "70a506754b1d99720b1029c0c49795c047fa03512eb6efbb3b7a08af193bacc8", "ja": "おーっと！　さらに野々原茜選手、\n丸太ローリング滝下りゾーンを危なげなくクリア！", "zh": "哦哦──！野野原茜选手又更进一步，\n无惊无险通过了滚滚圆木滑瀑区！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "c1d330ea88c8ace98332a5b6be8c644dbf03ed09c317b7e22dd39f221dcc4a20", "ja": "あとはゴールまで一直線だ～！", "zh": "接下来直线前进就能抵达终点～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1011_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "b1aab36400b986f23e489f0b5c1e8b3bdb3c7bc5d47a345a8b08abcbe8062620", "ja": "優勝は……765プロの野々原茜ちゃん！\n初参戦で堂々の優勝、おめでとうございます！", "zh": "冠军是……765艺能的野野原茜！\n首次参赛就漂亮夺冠，恭喜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "6a158a674e1e7210f04cb0fa98cfd708ef287985f24b06c8a16796c02920a3d6", "ja": "イェーイ！　劇場のみんな、見てる～？\n茜ちゃん、大勝利だよー！！", "zh": "耶──！剧场的伙伴们有在收看吗～？\n小茜大获全胜喔──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "a46a81a736f69a89c224125da57e4a780753c815811ba576a7b3927ba0b86b50", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、たっだいま～！", "zh": "小{$P$}，小茜回来啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "13ccb5aad9847d38f7e507dbb5923c5e82ac5a383c06ebaf74c98d7bc4dca1b0", "ja": "お、おかえり。完全に今までどおりのままだな……。\nというか、初出場で優勝するとは……！", "zh": "欢、欢迎回来，你还是表现得跟往常一模一样呢……\n不过，没想到初次登场就拿下了冠军……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d695b08b29ce609f324e28a49c7447f7f08b1e953439405100d32074a990a8a4", "ja": "（この番組を通じて、業界の厳しさを少しでも\n学んでくれればと思ったんだが……失敗か）", "zh": "（原本希望她能透过这个节目，\n多少了解到业界的残酷……结果失败了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "5c0b7fc98f833d777de4d068c29aa353b90ac2e50a93f7aff2bbefd5cd3dcc42", "ja": "う～む……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5ce212c8a5282b52e408a6b0b4035216ef736e41802ac4c7f85c70bf7b8ab13d", "ja": "？　どうしたんだ、茜。\n優勝したっていうのに、難しい顔して。", "zh": "怎么了，茜？\n明明拿到冠军，怎么愁眉苦脸的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "c9c41b5909450904f456634f66f34d6dafa838181e89b5d2436a50a6637f8265", "ja": "うん……今回の収録、茜ちゃん的には、\n超ヨユーだったんだけど。なんか、考えちゃってさ。", "zh": "嗯……这次的录影对小茜来说超级轻松，\n但小茜思考了一些事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "41c750b452ac4745cffba3fa240e7e63923a7059387279def637772a3e20a04e", "ja": "……というと？", "zh": "……思考什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "61c8ae516d6fac01f3fb58937abc36558434a86e344425396470ea26168e888b", "ja": "アトラクションに失敗したのに、茜ちゃんより\nお客さんの笑いを取った子もいたでしょ？", "zh": "有的人虽然挑战游戏设施失败了，\n却比小茜博得更多观众的笑声，对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "6c69120eb5e61afaf2ff6c4d640761e13681bada627f3d119d2145f5b0109510", "ja": "最後まで諦めずに丸太にかじりついてるトコが、\nカメラマンちゃんに抜かれた子もいたし……。", "zh": "还有人被摄影师拍到紧抓着圆木，\n直到最后都没有放弃的特写画面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "769c011027ac7ef26b8691e28545a5fae9f205d6647757146d4f6bee8a39e27a", "ja": "そうだったな。みんなそれだけ、カメラに映る事……\nテレビに出る事に、本気だったんだ。", "zh": "没错，大家都这么认真想被镜头拍到……\n想出现在电视上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "5b52aa40359aae2d31decf42f6f2fd91052f05662ed326b1bb672edb0a49aaf7", "ja": "今回はたまたま、茜ちゃんがチョー天才万能カンペキ\n美少女だったから、あっさり優勝できちゃったけど。", "zh": "这次因为小茜碰巧是超级天才万能完美的美少女，\n才会轻而易举拿下冠军──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "6dab699d953f7adfcda203749620c8bbdb8efb10e237118cd38074852211888a", "ja": "カワイイだけじゃ、アイドル業界という修羅の国を\nこの先生き残れないかも……！って思ったんだよね～。", "zh": "但小茜在想啊～光是长得可爱的话，\n今后也许无法在水深火热的偶像业界生存下去……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "528d6b17d451f02fd741e1668f0e777eb8d26c7fe2433c2a9d998947d5f7041d", "ja": "クラスでは個性派キャラの茜ちゃんも、\nアイドル業界では一般ピーポーも同然……。", "zh": "在班上属于个性派角色的小茜，\n进入偶像业界就跟普通人没两样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "5155502722fc208379a8d823b30e7a2ff2ad8ecd14f52ecc7de566c0bb9b9d46", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんは、\nこのことを茜ちゃんに教えたかったんだよね？", "zh": "小{$P$}想告诉小茜的，\n应该就是这个道理对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "78d22110c3f4cbada6a00d52a923ef080cad1aad45502f36c021669840ee58ca", "ja": "あ、ああ、そのとおりだ！\nちゃんと大事なことを学べたようで、何よりだよ。", "zh": "对、对的，没有错！\n看来你有好好学到重要的一课，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "572184ee045e5adf7c24cf3a1b141fd5a0c09f2b6a4f700a38d27298ca9588a7", "ja": "うん、ありがとう！　{$P$}ちゃんも\nたまにはタメになること教えてくれるんだね！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你！\n小{$P$}偶尔也会教有用的东西呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0f5b5d831a4b5b7656907e0383b391e1d294eeb616b1dac8da699b1839db1068", "ja": "ははは、たまにじゃないぞ！\n……とにかく、明日からも気を抜かずに頑張ろうな！", "zh": "哈哈哈，不只偶尔好吗！\n……总之，明天起也别掉以轻心，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_023aka_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "eee4e5a560db84107034a2d983d099f03621a8bdd651d1350e4acac44787ccd5", "ja": "（最初の思惑からは外れたが……茜が前向きに\n努力する、きっかけにはなったみたいだな！）", "zh": "（虽然偏离我一开始的意图……\n但似乎成为让茜积极努力的契机了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
